Open the sidemenu
Click the "E-Chart" link
Type "Hart" in the "sstring" input
Click the "Search" button
Click the "TEST-10019" link
Click the "Add Visit" link
Open the "Encounter" dynamicsection
Enter "Selenium, Selen" in the provider_chart_ac_input autocomplete
Close the "Encounter" dynamicsection
@Wait for the page to finish loading@driver.waitFor(driver, lambda d: d.getElement(xpath='//div[@class="wcstatus_bar" and style="opacity: 0;"]'), expected_return=True, timeout=15)
Unmask dynamicsection
Open the "Tests & procedures" dynamicsection
Click the "In House Testing Pick List" icon
@Wait for the picklist window@driver.wcutils.waitFor(lambda d: d.getElement(xpath="//div[@id='In House Testing_picklists_orderwin0']"))
Select "Questionnaires" from the "next_set_name" dropdown
Click the "Animal Allergy Questionnaire" checkbox
Click the "Add Procedures" button
Verify exists the "Animal Allergy Questionnaire" dynamicsection
